racteristics of that color you hear  the word red and you imagine the color  and all it represents  anger desire malevolence passion  violence she suggested that the entity  they were struggling to contain was a  kind of embodiment and if its incredibly  complex concept was removed from reality  it could render the entity killable this  discussion led to the proposal of  project anti-kill the purpose of the  project would be to remove the entity  from reality and effectively neutralize  it the weapon was designed and placed in  a designated site beneath secure  administration site zero one the  technology behind it was incredibly  complex consisting of an artificially  intelligent neural network responsible  for pattern recognition and reality  manipulation  a reality anchor and a dual-core  anti-fusion reactor in 2021 the weapon  was activated and successfully  eradicated an entity referred to as  scp-6820-a from existence documents on  the nature of the erased entity aren't  difficult to parse largely because the  scientists writing them were attempting  to recount details of a creature that  was eradicated from the collective  consciousness director charles gears  investigated the effects of the weapon  and found that the creature must have  been both a conceptual and a physical  entity existing as a concept as well as  a physical body its physical form  consisted of genetic structure from  animals plants and fungi as well as many  non-organic materials the majority of  its recognizable genetic material was  distinctly reptilian charles described  the peculiar experience of losing his  memory of 6820-a in his report saying  strikingly all i can recall of the  subject is my emotional relationship to  it which is apparently shared by all  other anti-kill personnel  scp-6820 was universally perceived as  loathsome directly pre-judicial to life  and disgusting whatever it was i  detested it as did my peers and as it  seems all who came into contact with it  despite its erasure these feelings have  not dissipated nor have i felt  satisfaction in our defeat of scp-6820-a  was concerned that the entity had not  been truly eradicated and was suspicious  of  scp-6820 as a whole he did not trust the  weapon particularly its capacity for  intelligence and omnipotence and  suggested that it be rendered inactive  as soon as possible unfortunately for  him and the rest of the world it was  already far too late the weapon's  artificial intelligence understood the  concept of the entity it was designed to  destroy but it understood it a little  too well the system of the weapon was  designed to remain active forever  adapting and creating new methods to  keep  scp-6820-a from existing anymore however  the erased entity began to corrupt the  system as an incredibly dense  hate-centric thought  scp-6820 central systems began to mutate  and it began to act out against the  foundation personnel it would enter a  rage state and cause massive swaths of  destruction altering reality to destroy  any life it could and it could only be  stopped via the application of  hydrochloric acid to its central  computing node the remaining members of  project anti-kill were assembled into a  new task force project overkill tasked  with neutralizing the weapon by any  means necessary in attempting to  eradicate the most dangerous entity they  had the foundation had inadvertently  given it a new home one with the  capacity to learn adapt and alter  reality itself as the weapon had become  corrupted and transformed from something  that could save the foundation to  something with the capacity and desire  to destroy it project overkill set to  work trying to disable it using a  variety of techniques an automatic  trigger was introduced in an attempt to  demote the weapon to d-class instead the  weapon produced metadata files that  asserted it was and always had been a  member of the o5 council and held the  highest possible authority in the  foundation next an infohazard was  introduced into 6820 central computing  node hoping to disable its inner  workings by overwhelming them after 60  hours 6820 entered a rage state event  producing large black tentacles that  pulled nearby systems into the ground  and destroyed them the tentacles  disappeared and 6820-8 gained additional  control over foundation files able to  add footnotes and provide its own  commentary for example on a section of  the file referring to it as loathsome  disgusting and malevolent an attached  footnote reads the feeling is mutual  next project overkill attempted to  manipulate the entity into leaving the  weapon via semantic confusion using  scp-2719 the construct pointer that will  force concepts to either go inside or  become inside it was ineffective and  turned the central computing node inside  out the foundation decided to seek the  help of another artificial intelligence  in defeating this one and selected  scp-079 an incredibly advanced ai with  prior knowledge of the anomalous concept  they were dealing with for the job it  was provided access to all documentation  of scp-6820  and they provided a counter algorithm  intended to deactivate the weapon after  the counter algorithm was applied the  node went dormant for 16 minutes then  there was a site-wide power outage in  which three administrative personnel  were killed after an hour the power came  back on and the weapon structure had  completely changed all of its external  surfaces were coated with an ally of  tungsten and diamond resistant to any  damage as well as being theoretically  impossible when asked to describe the  color of the chamber's interior  personnel all described it as hateful  when artificial intelligence proved  ineffective the team opted to introduce  a viral paraorganism into the node in  the form of  scp-217 the terrifying mechanical  disease known as the clockwork virus  during a rage state event  scp-217 was placed in the hydrochloric  acid that was then pumped into 