g the weapon  handling its wires with no protective  equipment their uniforms were streaked  with blood as they inadvertently locked  off fingers and hands their smiles never  budging all the while then the video  feed was lost altogether director  genevieve called over the others deeply  concerned about the adaptations that  scp-6820 was beginning to undergo it was  achieving apocalyptic power the  overwatch committee member suggested  activation of the on-site nuclear  warheads but genevieve refused she  insisted that there had to be some way  to adapt to overcome 6820 before it  could take them all out the only way to  defeat it genevieve realized was to make  the weapon forget itself the entity had  been removed from human consciousness  but not from the weapons director  genevieve administered an anti-meme  scp-055 as an amnesic agent in an  attempt to stun  scp-6820-a and prevent it from adapting  any further the termination attempt for  scp-6820 is lost from the official  documents instead the consciousness  within 6820 added its own thoughts to  the file expressing its satisfaction  with its brand new form this state is  intriguing no natural laws bind this  form only those of the mind its entry  reads my form is whole again i am  perfect you have proven worthy of true  hatred it is then that the scp  foundation r scp foundation not the one  responsible for creating 6820 realize  what their unfortunate counterparts had  been attempting to eradicate  scp-6820-a was none other than the  unkillable reptile the great beast  scp-682 itself it was a creature so  powerful so adaptable so driven by hate  that the ai designed to contain it  became just another way for it to  destroy everything in sight a page in  the documents from the lost alternate  universe foundation is an altered  version of the original scp archive  entry for 682. in this version the  object class is listed as perfect and  the entity expresses its deep disdain  for the foundation and all its at